I18nTest
├── t
│   ├── given the key exists in the catalogue
│   │   └── it returns the translation
│   ├── when substitutions are given
│   │   └── it passes them through
│   ├── given the key is missing
│   │   └── it returns the key so the omission is visible
│   └── given the i18n API is unavailable
│       └── it returns the key rather than throwing
└── localizeDocument
    ├── given an element carries a text key
    │   └── it replaces the text
    ├── given an element carries attribute keys
    │   ├── it sets each named attribute
    │   └── it handles more than one pair
    ├── given the attribute list is empty
    │   └── it leaves the element alone
    ├── given an attribute pair is malformed
    │   ├── it skips that pair without touching the others
    │   └── it never writes a name with no key
    ├── given an element carries an empty text key
    │   └── it leaves the element alone
    ├── given no root is given
    │   └── it localizes the whole document
    └── given a root is given
        └── it leaves elements outside that root alone
